[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0010","text":"最后也好好完成了呢\n辛苦了，甜花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0020","text":"嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0030","text":"……已经，结束了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0040","text":"……甜花？\n好不容易可以回去了，怎么看起来有点寂寞"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0050","text":"那个，回去之后……\n就……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0060","text":"……说起来，我还欠甜花一场胜负呢\n最后再去一次游戏厅怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0070","text":"想去……！\n……啊，但是……可以吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0080","text":"嗯，这点时间还是有的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0090","text":"我也不能就这么输着回去啊！\n走吧，甜花！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02011500_03_0100","text":"嘿嘿……\n嗯……！"}]
